(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). NeMo has no NOTICE file. The
module is a new implementation for strings of that logic: it holds no file of
NeMo, it needs no NeMo or torch package, and it differs from NeMo in the two
places that its module docstring lists.

The module downloads two data files from the Hugging Face repository
Phoonnx/magpietts-multi-357m-unicode: ipa_cmudict-0.7b_nv23.01.txt, which is
the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary (BSD-2-Clause, see
scriptconv/phonemizers/_thirdparty/dizione/built/LICENSE.cmudict) with IPA
pronunciations, and heteronyms-052722. Neither file is in the wheel.
